unNativeTraceImage \\\n3086:  Always write traces to a temporary directory, not to `metadata/<group>/<artifact>/<version>`. The trace output may be partial when the native test fails. Merge one or more trace output directories with:\n3089:  ./gradlew mergeNativeTraceMetadata \\\n3094:  Rebuild with merged metadata for another tracing iteration:\n3097:  ./gradlew nativeTraceImage \\\n3108:  ./gradlew splitTestOnlyMetadata -Pcoordinates=org.postgresql:postgresql:42.7.3\n3109:  ./gradlew splitTestOnlyMetadata -Pcoordinates=org.postgresql:postgresql\n3110:  ./gradlew splitTestOnlyMetadata -Pcoordinates=1/16\n3113:  ### Fix failing tasks\n3115:  Use this when a library's new version causes native-image run test failures. The task will:\n3126:  ./gradlew fixTestNativeImageRun -PtestLibraryCoordinates=org.postgresql:postgresql:42.7.3 -PnewLibraryVersion=42.7.4\n3133:     ./gradlew checkAllowedDockerImages --baseCommit=$(git rev-parse origin/master) --newCommit=$(git rev-parse HEAD)\n3138:     ./gradlew checkAllowedDockerImages\n3149:      ./gradlew fetchExistingLibrariesWithNewerVersions --quiet\n3154:      ./gradlew addTestedVersion -Pcoordinates=\"group:artifact:newVersion\" --lastSupportedVersion=\"oldVersion\"\n3158:      ./gradlew addTestedVersion -Pcoordinates=\"org.postgresql:postgresql:42.7.4\" --lastSupportedVersion=\"42.7.3\"\n3164:  ./gradlew package\n3169:  - Style: `./gradlew checkstyle`\n3170:  - Format check: `./gradlew spotlessCheck`\n3171:  - Format apply: `./gradlew spotlessApply`\n3172:  - Pull images (single lib): `./gradlew pullAllowedDockerImages -Pcoordinates=[group:artifact:version|k/n|all]`\n3173:  - Check metadata (single lib): `./gradlew checkMetadataFiles -Pcoordinates=[group:artifact:version|k/n|all]`\n3174:  - Generate metadata (single lib): `./gradlew generateMetadata -Pcoordinates=group:artifact:version`\n3175:  - Build trace-enabled native image: `./gradlew nativeTraceImage -Pcoordinates=group:artifact:version`\n3176:  - Run trace-enabled native image: `./gradlew runNativeTraceImage -Pcoordinates=group:artifact:version -PtraceMetadataPath=<absolute-trace-output-dir> -PtraceMetadataConditionPackages=<package1,package2,...>`\n3177:  - Merge native trace metadata: `./gradlew mergeNativeTraceMetadata -PinputDirs=<absolute-trace-output-dir-0>,<absolute-trace-output-dir-1>,... -PoutputDir=<absolute-merged-metadata-dir>`\n3178:  - Split test-only metadata: `./gradlew splitTestOnlyMetadata -Pcoordinates=[group:artifact:version|group:artifact|k/n|all]`\n3179:  - Fix test that fails Native Image run for new library version: `./gradlew fixTestNativeImageRun -PtestLibraryCoordinates=group:artifact:version -PnewLibraryVersion=version`\n3180:  - Test (single lib): `./gradlew test -Pcoordinates=[group:artifact:version|k/n|all]`\n3181:  - List resolved tested-library jars: `./gradlew listLibraryJars -Pcoordinates=[group:artifact:version|k/n|all]`\n3182:  - Generate dynamic access report: `./gradlew generateDynamicAccessReport -Pcoordinates=[group:artifact:version|k/n|all]`\n3183:  - Generate dynamic access coverage report: `./gradlew generateDynamicAccessCoverageReport -Pcoordinates=[group:artifact:version|k/n|all]`\n3184:    Output: `metadata/<group>/<artifact>/<version>/test/build/reports/dynamic-access/dynamic-access-coverage.json`\n3186:  - Coverage (single lib): `./gradlew jacocoTestReport -Pcoordinates=[group:artifact:version|k/n|all]`\n3187:  - Generate library stats: `./gradlew generateLibraryStats -Pcoordinates=[group:artifact:version|group:artifact|k/n|all]`\n3188:  - Validate library stats: `./gradlew validateLibraryStats`\n3189:  - List available coordinates: `./gradlew listCoordinates -Pcoordinates=[group:artifact:version|group:artifact|k/n|all] [-PstrictCoordinates=true]`\n3190:  - Generate dependency graph: `./gradlew generateDependencyGraph -Pcoordinates=[group:artifact:version|group:artifact|k/n|all]`\n3191:  - Analyze external dynamic access: `./gradlew analyzeExternalLibraryDynamicAccess --coordina